//
//  1. OutputNormal => [1..8]
//     This mode provides 8 different colors:
//     black, red, green, yellow, blue, magenta, cyan, white
//     Shortcut: ColorBlack, ColorRed, ...
//     Attributes: AttrBold, AttrUnderline, AttrReverse
//
//     Example usage:
//     SetCell(x, y, '@', ColorBlack | AttrBold, ColorRed);
